### =============================================================
### VS Code "REST Client" 확장 / IntelliJ HTTP Client 용 요청 모음
### 각 요청 위의 "Send Request" 를 클릭해 실행 (쿠키는 자동 저장·전송됨)
### =============================================================
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 0. 회원가입
POST {{base}}/users/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "hong", "email": "hong@example.com", "password": "1234" }

### 0. 회원가입 (두 번째 사용자)
POST {{base}}/users/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "kim", "email": "kim@example.com", "password": "5678" }


### ------------------------- 1-1. 평문 쿠키 -------------------------
POST {{base}}/cookie/v1/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "hong", "password": "1234" }

###
GET {{base}}/cookie/v1/me

### ⚠ 쿠키 위조: 로그인 없이 user_id=2 로 접근
GET {{base}}/cookie/v1/me
Cookie: user_id=2


### ------------------------- 1-2. 서명 쿠키 -------------------------
POST {{base}}/cookie/v2/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "hong", "password": "1234" }

###
GET {{base}}/cookie/v2/me

### 쿠키 내용은 누구나 디코딩 가능 (암호화 아님)
GET {{base}}/cookie/v2/inspect

### 서명 변조 → 401
GET {{base}}/cookie/v2/me
Cookie: auth=eyJ1aWQiOjIsInVuYW1lIjoia2ltIn0.AAAAAA.forged-signature

###
POST {{base}}/cookie/v2/logout


### ------------------------- 2. 서버 세션 -------------------------
POST {{base}}/session/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "hong", "password": "1234" }

###
GET {{base}}/session/me

###
GET {{base}}/session/mypage

###
GET {{base}}/session/devices

###
POST {{base}}/session/logout

###
POST {{base}}/session/logout-all
